{"seq":2,"slug":"ladder-pricing-inventory-reservation","title":"阶梯价与动态折扣：分段定价、承诺价一致性与库存预占","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-group-buying-team-purchase-commerce-engineering/group-formation-engine-inventory-pricing/ladder-pricing-inventory-reservation","wordCount":3465,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"阶梯价与动态折扣-分段定价-承诺价一致性与库存预占\">阶梯价与动态折扣：分段定价、承诺价一致性与库存预占</h1><p>拼团的定价不是给商品贴一个价签，而是给「人数」贴价签。同样是这件商品，3 人成团是 59 元、10 人成团是 49 元、50 人成团是 39 元——价格成了参团人数的一个分段函数。可价格一旦随人数滑动，库存预占就不能再按「单价 × 数量」这一条直线走：用户在 3 人档下的单，最终可能以 50 人档成交，也可能因为档位回退而需要补价或退款。阶梯价与库存预占因此是同一个问题的两面——<strong>价格是承诺，库存是兑现承诺的物理约束，两者必须在成团那一刻同步收敛</strong>。成团时间线本身（待成团 → 成团 → 失败 → 退款）见兄弟文档<a href=\"group-formation-lifecycle-engine\">成团生命周期引擎</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-阶梯价是参团人数的分段函数\">核心概念：阶梯价是参团人数的分段函数</h2><p>阶梯价（ladder pricing，又称阶梯团、人数阶梯价）定义一个<strong>分段常值函数</strong>：给定团的累计参团人数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（或金额、件数），成交单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 按档位边界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1 &lt; t_2 &lt; \\dots &lt; t_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>当</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1..</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(n) = p_i \\quad \\text{当} \\quad t_{i-1} \\le n &lt; t_i,\\qquad t_0 = 0,\\ i = 1..k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1..</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  N[累计参团人数 n] --&gt; B1{&quot;n &lt; t1 ?&quot;}&#10;  B1 --&gt;|是| P1[第1档价 p1]&#10;  B1 --&gt;|否| B2{&quot;n &lt; t2 ?&quot;}&#10;  B2 --&gt;|是| P2[第2档价 p2]&#10;  B2 --&gt;|否| P3[第 k 档价 pk&lt;br/&gt;人数越多单价越低]\">graph TD\n  N[累计参团人数 n] --&gt; B1{\"n &lt; t1 ?\"}\n  B1 --&gt;|是| P1[第1档价 p1]\n  B1 --&gt;|否| B2{\"n &lt; t2 ?\"}\n  B2 --&gt;|是| P2[第2档价 p2]\n  B2 --&gt;|否| P3[第 k 档价 pk&lt;br/&gt;人数越多单价越低]</pre><p>这个函数有三个必须在数据模型里显式化的性质。第一是<strong>单调不增</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1 \\ge p_2 \\ge \\dots \\ge p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，人数越多单价越低，否则阶梯失去激励意义。第二是<strong>左闭右开</strong>：达到 10 人属于第 2 档而非仍在第 1 档，边界归属必须唯一，否则并发补位时会出现「第 10 个人进来但价格还没跳」的竞态。第三是<strong>档位是配置而非常量</strong>：档位表要能随商品、活动、场次调整，且历史团一旦落定就不允许被新配置重判——这正是「承诺价一致性」的起点。</p>\n<p>档位表是一张与商品解耦的配置记录，常见字段是 <code>(sku_id, tier_index, min_quantity, unit_price, currency)</code>。判定不要硬编码在业务代码里，而应收敛成一个纯函数 <code>resolveTier(quantity, tiers)</code>，让它对同一输入幂等。</p>\n<p>与纯人数阶梯并列的变体是<strong>动态折扣</strong>：让折扣率随进度连续变化，例如「已参团 7/10 人，当前价 = 基准价 − (达成率 × 最大让利)」。连续折扣更平滑，但价格随人数实时跳动、前端每次刷新都要重算，且「显示价」与「成团价」的落差需要被管理。稳妥做法是把它<strong>量化为有限档位</strong>（例如每 10% 达成率一档），保留激励感的同时避免价格抖动与浮点比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承诺价一致性-下单价-成团价-退款价的三角\">承诺价一致性：下单价、成团价、退款价的三角</h2><p>阶梯价带来的最尖锐矛盾，是「用户下单时看到的价格」与「团最终成交的价格」可能不一致。三个价格必须在成团那一刻对齐，且对齐的结果只能是三者之一：加价、减价（返差）、或原价成交。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价格</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>何时确定</th>\n<th>用户感知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>下单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>order</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{order}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>用户点击参团时按当时人数解析出的档位价</td>\n<td>参团瞬间冻结</td>\n<td>支付页显示，构成契约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成团价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{final}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>成团时刻按最终人数解析出的档位价</td>\n<td>成团判定时</td>\n<td>结算价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款/返差价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>order</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = p_{\\text{order}} - p_{\\text{final}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>成团后补偿流程</td>\n<td>差额退回或补收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>主流产品在这里采取**「低价承诺」**立场：只可能返差（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>），绝不让用户补价（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 一律不允许）。原因是补价触及消费者权益与信息披露规则——用户在支付页确认的金额是一次要约承诺，事后追加收款在多数司法辖区需要重新取得用户同意，且实现成本高（重新拉起支付、二次授权）而体验极差。真要把「人数越多越贵」的倒挂（罕见，通常出现在稀缺资源抢购场景）做成合法流程，也必须显式二次确认，不能静默扣款。</p>\n<p>反过来，若用户先以高价档下单、团最终以更低的低价档成团，平台必须<strong>主动返差</strong>。返差有两种路径：成团后发起一笔小额退款（部分退款），或在下单时就用「预授权按最高档冻结、成团后按实收档扣款」的方式从源头避免多收。后者对资金效率更友好，因为差额从未真正入账；但对卡组织授权有效期敏感（见跨境一节）。</p>\n<p>这套「只降不升」的承诺必须写进状态机的不变量，并配一条断言：<strong>任何团的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>final</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>order</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p\\_{\\text{final}} \\le p\\_{\\text{order}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">final</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对所有参团者成立</strong>。若某次成团计算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>order</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{final}} &gt; p_{\\text{order}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，那不是定价问题而是配置或竞态的 bug，必须拦截成团而非静默按高价结算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库存预占模型-预留-实占与拼团特有难点\">库存预占模型：预留、实占与拼团特有难点</h2><p>普通电商的库存扣减模型是「下单即扣、超时释放」。拼团把这个模型拉长成三段：<strong>参团时预留（reserve）、成团时实占（commit）、失败时释放（release）</strong>。这在数据模型上是三张或一张带状态列的账：<code>available</code>、<code>reserved</code>、<code>committed</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[可售库存 available] --&gt;|参团请求| R[预留库存 reserved]&#10;  R --&gt;|成团判定| C[实占库存 committed]&#10;  R --&gt;|团失败/超时| A&#10;  C --&gt;|履约发货| S[出库扣减]&#10;  R --&gt;|用户取消参团| A\">graph TD\n  A[可售库存 available] --&gt;|参团请求| R[预留库存 reserved]\n  R --&gt;|成团判定| C[实占库存 committed]\n  R --&gt;|团失败/超时| A\n  C --&gt;|履约发货| S[出库扣减]\n  R --&gt;|用户取消参团| A</pre><p>拼团特有的难点在「预留」的粒度。一个团有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个可能参团位，但实际会不会来满完全未知。若按团的最大人数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一次性把库存锁死，一个永远凑不齐的团会长期占着几十件库存，可售率被拖垮；若每个参团者单独预留，则档位所需的库存总量在成团前始终是浮动的。务实的折中是<strong>按「当前所在档位的需求」预留，并在人数跨档时增量预留</strong>：团处在第 1 档时按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 件预留，人数触达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后升级到第 2 档并按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 件增量预留。跨档时的增量预占本身是一次有风险的原子操作——若增量预留失败（库存被别的团抢走），团应<strong>停在原档继续成团</strong>而不是直接失败，这是一条容易被忽略的降级路径。</p>\n<p>预留必须有<strong>存活期</strong>。预留的生命周期严格等于团的窗口：<code>expire_at = group_window_end</code>。窗口一到，无论团是成是败，预留都要么转实占要么释放，绝不允许出现「窗口已过但预留还挂着」的僵尸预占。判断依据永远是团的状态而非定时器消息本身，与生命周期引擎的原则一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"档位与库存的耦合-档位回退与库存漂移\">档位与库存的耦合：档位回退与库存漂移</h2><p>阶梯价和库存一旦耦合，会出现两类只有拼团才有的漂移。</p>\n<p>第一类是<strong>档位回退</strong>。某些产品允许用户退团，人数从 12 掉回 8，档位从第 3 档退回第 2 档。此时已按第 3 档预留的库存必须回落到第 2 档并释放多余预留；若成团前反复进退，价档和预留会高频抖动。工程上通常限制<strong>成团前最后一次人数快照决定档位</strong>，或直接禁止成团前退团（只允许取消整团），用产品约束换实现简单。</p>\n<p>第二类是<strong>成团时刻的库存竞态</strong>。成团判定与库存实占若分成两步，中间存在窗口：A 团在第 9 人进来时判定成团，正要实占库存；B 团与此同时把最后一件库存预留走了。若实占是「读 available 再写 committed」的朴素两步，就会超卖。正解是把实占做成<strong>带条件的原子更新</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE sku_stock&#10;SET    reserved  = reserved  - :qty,&#10;       committed = committed + :qty&#10;WHERE  sku_id    = :sku&#10;  AND  reserved &gt;= :qty;&#10;-- 影响行数为 0 说明预留已被释放或不足，必须回退成团判定\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_stock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reserved  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       committed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reserved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 影响行数为 0 说明预留已被释放或不足，必须回退成团判定</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条 SQL 把「预留转实占」变成一次 CAS，失败即意味着该团的库存前提已被破坏，应回退到失败或降档重试，而不是让 committed 超过物理库存。</p>\n<p>隐藏的第三类是<strong>档位价与实占数量的乘积对账</strong>。财务侧核对的是「实占金额 = 成团价 × 实占件数」，若某次降档后忘了同步更新已写下的价格快照，账面金额会与库存件数对不上。把价格与库存的更新放进同一次事务（或同一条事件驱动的补偿链）是防止这类错位的结构手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境场景-多币种阶梯价-税费与汇率\">跨境场景：多币种阶梯价、税费与汇率</h2><p>跨境拼团把上述矛盾乘上汇率与税制两个变量。阶梯价档位若直接以人民币定义、再实时换算成美元/欧元展示，用户看到的档位边界会随汇率浮动，同一天不同时刻下单价格不同，这构成价格披露风险。稳妥做法是<strong>每个市场用本币独立定义阶梯档位</strong>，让价格表成为市场级配置，换算只发生在结算与对账环节。</p>\n<p>税费是第二个变量。欧盟增值税（VAT）、英国 VAT、美国各州销售税（sales tax）对「到手价」的定义不同：欧盟要求展示含税价，美国习惯展示未含税的 shelf price 再在结算加税。这意味着<strong>阶梯价的档位边界要在含税或未含税的口径上二选一后保持全局一致</strong>，否则「49 元档」在两个市场代表不同的实际收入。同时，欧盟《消费者权利指令》(Directive 2011/83/EU) 与《Omnibus 指令》(Directive (EU) 2019/2161) 对远程销售的价格透明度与折扣前价格披露有明确要求——宣传「原价 99、拼团价 39」时，欧盟要求展示折扣前的参考价及其期限，虚构原价会被认定为误导性商业行为。中国侧对应的是《明码标价和禁止价格欺诈规定》（国家市场监督管理总局，2022 年 7 月 1 日施行），同样禁止虚构原价与虚假折扣。</p>\n<p>汇率风险落在退款与返差上。成团失败要原路退款，若下单与退款之间汇率变动，平台承担汇兑损益；跨境返差同理。规避手段是<strong>下单与退款用同一汇率锚点（按原交易汇率折算）</strong>，并把汇兑损益单列科目，而不是在退款金额里做手脚。</p>\n<p>最后是<strong>授权有效期</strong>。跨境卡支付常用的两步模式（先授权冻结、成团后扣款）受卡组织授权有效期约束：主流卡组织对未捕获授权的有效期通常为 5–7 天（如 Stripe 对多数卡的未捕获 PaymentIntent 在授权后约 7 天失效，Mastercard 授权持有期通常为数天）。这意味着<strong>成团窗口不能长于预授权有效期</strong>，否则到期授权失效、扣款失败，团虽然成了却收不到钱。为此，长窗口的跨境电商拼团更倾向「即时收款 + 失败退款」路径，而非「冻结 + 迟扣」，这样资金从下单即到手，只需承担退款链路的成本与合规义务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现的若干定式\">工程实现的若干定式</h2><p>把上述约束落成实现，有几条反复出现的定式：档位解析用纯函数 <code>resolveTier</code>（对同输入幂等），而非散落的 <code>if (n&gt;=10)</code> 硬编码；参团时写入不可变的 <code>order_price</code> 价格快照，而非成团时回查当前配置覆盖历史价；库存用 <code>available / reserved / committed</code> 三态列，而非单一 <code>stock</code> 列；实占用带 <code>reserved &gt;= qty</code> 条件的 CAS，而非先读后写两步；返差只降不升、差额自动退回，而非静默补收；预留 <code>expire_at</code> 严格等于团窗口结束、由状态驱动释放，而非依赖定时器消息判定超时；对账同时核对件数与金额（<code>成团价 × 实占件数 = 账面金额</code>），而非只对件数。</p>\n<p>端到端流程收敛成一条每步幂等、可重放的事件链：参团请求 → <code>resolveTier</code> 解析档位并冻结 <code>p_order</code> 快照 → 按当前档位增量预留库存 → 等待成团窗口 → 达标则重算 <code>p_final</code> 并<strong>校验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>final</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>order</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p\\_{\\text{final}} \\le p\\_{\\text{order}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">final</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，不成立即拦截</strong> → 预留转实占 CAS → 成功则按 <code>p_final</code> 结算（需要则返差），失败则降档重试或判失败；超时未达标则释放全部预留并原路退款。其中「校验不成立即拦截」是整条链的护栏，它把承诺价一致性从靠自觉的约定变成强制检查——任何绕过它的优化路径，都会在某个并发边界上把「低价承诺」变成「高价事故」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>阶梯价是参团人数的<strong>分段常值函数</strong>，必须显式化单调不增、左闭右开、配置可调三个性质；动态连续折扣宜量化为有限档位以避免抖动。</li>\n<li>承诺价一致性收敛为一条不变量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>order</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{final}} \\le p_{\\text{order}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 恒成立，只降不升，差额主动退回，并把该校验做成成团前的强制门。</li>\n<li>库存预占采用 <code>available / reserved / committed</code> 三态，预留按当前档位增量进行，预留存活期严格等于团窗口、由状态驱动释放。</li>\n<li>档位回退与成团时刻的实占竞态是拼团特有陷阱：前者用产品约束（成团前限退）缓解，后者用 <code>reserved &gt;= qty</code> 的 CAS 消灭。</li>\n<li>跨境场景叠加本币独立档位、含税/未含税口径一致、退款汇率锚点、卡组织授权有效期（通常 5–7 天）四条约束，长窗口更适合「即时收款 + 失败退款」。</li>\n<li>价格披露受监管约束（欧盟 Directive 2011/83/EU 与 2019/2161、中国《明码标价和禁止价格欺诈规定》），禁止虚构原价。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>成团后如何把多个团并单、拆单并进入发货，见<a href=\"../crossborder-group-fulfillment-ops/\">跨境拼团履约运营</a>；拼团的交易模型与聚合边界见<a href=\"../group-buying-model-group-as-order/\">团即订单：拼团交易模型与聚合边界</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"阶梯价与动态折扣：分段定价、承诺价一致性与库存预占","id":"阶梯价与动态折扣-分段定价-承诺价一致性与库存预占"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：阶梯价是参团人数的分段函数","id":"核心概念-阶梯价是参团人数的分段函数"},{"level":2,"text":"承诺价一致性：下单价、成团价、退款价的三角","id":"承诺价一致性-下单价-成团价-退款价的三角"},{"level":2,"text":"库存预占模型：预留、实占与拼团特有难点","id":"库存预占模型-预留-实占与拼团特有难点"},{"level":2,"text":"档位与库存的耦合：档位回退与库存漂移","id":"档位与库存的耦合-档位回退与库存漂移"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境场景：多币种阶梯价、税费与汇率","id":"跨境场景-多币种阶梯价-税费与汇率"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现的若干定式","id":"工程实现的若干定式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成团生命周期引擎：待成团/成团/失败/自动退款的驱动与超时补偿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-group-buying-team-purchase-commerce-engineering/group-formation-engine-inventory-pricing/group-formation-lifecycle-engine"},"next":{"title":"未成团退单、并单拆单与多参与方资金结算的异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-group-buying-team-purchase-commerce-engineering/group-formation-engine-inventory-pricing/underfilled-group-merge-settlement"}}